 $-$NuWro & \fvval{f0b-A7_nuwro-chi2} & $\fvval{f0b-A7_nuwro-p}$ & \fvval{f0b-A7_nuwro-cells} & \fvval{f0-A7_nuwro-chi2} & $\fvval{f0-A7_nuwro-p}$ & \fvval{f0-A7_nuwro-cells} \\ NuWro, $\Eavail$ shape & $-$NuWro & \fvval{f0b-W1-chi2} & $\fvval{f0b-W1-p}$ & \fvval{f0b-W1-cells} & \fvval{f0-W1-chi2} & $\fvval{f0-W1-p}$ & \fvval{f0-W1-cells} \\ NuWro, $(\pT,\pPar,\Eavail)$ shape & $-$NuWro & \fvval{f0b-W3-chi2} & $\fvval{f0b-W3-p}$ & \fvval{f0b-W3-cells} & \fvval{f0-W3-chi2} & $\fvval{f0-W3-p}$ & \fvval{f0-W3-cells} \\ NuWro, closure & $-$NuWro & \fvval{f0b-closure_nuwro-chi2} & $\fvval{f0b-closure_nuwro-p}$ & \fvval{f0b-closure_nuwro-cells} & \fvval{f0-closure_nuwro-chi2} & $\fvval{f0-closure_nuwro-p}$ & \fvval{f0-closure_nuwro-cells} \\ GiBUU, $\Eavail$ shape & $-$GiBUU & \fvval{f0b-stage0c_gibuu-chi2} & $\fvval{f0b-stage0c_gibuu-p}$ & \fvval{f0b-stage0c_gibuu-cells} & \fvval{f0-stage0c_gibuu-chi2} & $\fvval{f0-stage0c_gibuu-p}$ & \fvval{f0-stage0c_gibuu-cells} \\ GiBUU, hybrid & $-$GiBUU & \fvval{f0b-A7_gibuu-chi2} & $\fvval{f0b-A7_gibuu-p}$ & \fvval{f0b-A7_gibuu-cells} & \fvval{f0-A7_gibuu-chi2} & $\fvval{f0-A7_gibuu-p}$ & \fvval{f0-A7_gibuu-cells} \\ synthetic $q_3$ tilt & full & \fvval{f0b-q3-chi2} & $\fvval{f0b-q3-p}$ & \fvval{f0b-q3-cells} & \fvval{f0-q3-chi2} & $\fvval{f0-q3-p}$ & \fvval{f0-q3-cells} \\ \bottomrule \end{tabular} \end{table*} Under the reported covariance, without the GiBUU component for the two GiBUU truths, the bias is listed at the GiBUU $\Eavail$ shape (cell R06, $z=\fvval{f0b-stage0c_gibuu-zmax}$), at the GiBUU hybrid truth ($p=\fvval{f0b-A7_gibuu-p}$; cells \fvval{f0b-A7_gibuu-cells}) and at the synthetic $q_3$ tilt ($p=\fvval{f0b-q3-p}$): the reported uncertainty does not cover the fake-data bias at these GiBUU-like truths or at the $q_3$ tilt.
